[* 
*   rdn file that will be loaded at the runtime
*   platform.rdn is hight level layer of platform manipulations
*   it protect backward complatible in case the native layer API has been
*   upgraded or changed
* *]

[* RMPPlatform *]
enum RMP_PLATFORM_LINUX    const
enum RMP_PLATFORM_WINDOWS    const
enum RMP_PLATFORM_MAC    const
enum RMP_PLATFORM_UNKNOW    const
reset

[* 
*   rmp_platform: returns host platform enum value
*   example:
*       rmp_platform call -> integer [RMPPlatform]
* *]
rmp_platform defun
    rmp_platform_native call
end
